  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Kochi to Bangalore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for bike transport from Kochi to Bangalore calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price is based on the bike’s make and model, distance (approximately 850 km), weight, and any special handling requirements. Our transparent freight tariff includes fuel surcharge, GST, and optional insurance. We also factor in any additional services such as doorstep pickup in Kochi or expedited delivery in Bangalore.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance options are available for my two‑wheeler during the Kochi‑to‑Bangalore shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities. Customers can choose the standard coverage or upgrade to a higher sum insured for premium protection. All insurance details are outlined in the final quote and can be customized as needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transport from Kochi to Bangalore typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the transit time ranges from 2 to 3 days, including loading, en‑route rest stops, and unloading. Our hydraulic ramp trailers and dedicated GPS tracking ensure efficient routing along NH 44/NH 33, minimizing delays and providing real‑time updates to the customer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need to prepare any documents for the bike shipment between Kochi and Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, you’ll need a valid registration certificate, insurance copy, and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government moves, GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills are required. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to ensure smooth customs‑free interstate transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What measures are taken to prevent scratches or damage to my bike during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is wrapped in our proprietary 7‑layer protective system, topped with a scratch‑guard film. The bike is then secured on hydraulic ramp trailers using high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks. Live GPS monitoring and a zero‑scratch guarantee further ensure your bike arrives pristine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s journey from Kochi to Bangalore in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our covered trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices that provide live location updates via a secure portal. You’ll receive instant notifications at key milestones—pickup, departure, en‑route checks, and delivery—so you’re always informed of your bike’s status.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any additional services if I need my bike delivered to a specific floor or building in Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we offer full‑doorstep delivery, which includes navigating elevators, stairs, or loading docks as required. Our trained crew handles the bike with care, using the same 7‑layer packing and ramp system, ensuring a seamless handover at your exact location.</p>
